<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A8.T8.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 8</span>: </span><span id="A8.T8.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">
<span id="A8.T8.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Error-bucket analysis by proxy–human disagreement mismatch.</span>
TO denotes Tradeoff, computed from human-loop statistics as <math id="A8.T8.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mu}-\lambda\hat{\sigma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mu}-\lambda\hat{\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math>.
<math id="A8.T8.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> denotes mean improvement in TO over the baseline within each bucket.
Bucket edges: <math id="A8.T8.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.0255,0.4061,0.4472,0.6737,0.8457,3.1948" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0255</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.4061</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.4472</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.6737</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.8457</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.1948</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.0255,0.4061,0.4472,0.6737,0.8457,3.1948</annotation></semantics></math>.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A8.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">H.9 </span>Per-scorer breakdown for multi-scorer evaluation</h3>

<div id="A8.SS9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.SS9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To complement the aggregated multi-scorer results in the main text, we report a per-scorer breakdown of win/tie/loss (W/T/L) and mean score difference (<math id="A8.SS9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>) against the Base (mean Best-of-<math id="A8.SS9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>) baseline.
We evaluate each selected output under each reward model separately, on both the overall prompt set and the high-disagreement (high-<math id="A8.SS9.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\sigma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math>) subset defined by the baseline.</p>
</div>
